== r3.99 (A1): the module's own Fee comes before the Fee it imports; the
== imported one is reached by its qualified name (A2).
Use Bank.Accounts

Fee(Value Integer) Integer :
    Return Value + 1
;

Main :
    PutLn(Fee(10), " ", Bank.Accounts.Fee(10))
;
